   "date": "2013-03-18",
   "stage_hint": null,
   "brief": "The Export Market Development Grants Amendment Bill 2013 was introduced to concentrate the EMDG scheme on small businesses exporting to East Asian and frontier/emerging markets, saving $25 million annually by increasing grants to those markets from seven to eight while reducing grants to the US, Canada, the UK and the EU from seven to five, effective 1 July 2013."
